"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"There is no complete selectable award journey in these search results, so I can’t recommend a bookable award itinerary. The most useful lead to check first is the United economy result for January 9: it reports 55,000 United miles and 9 seats, with the lowest listed USD fees among these three leads. The tradeoff is that it gives only a date—not a schedule or routing—and its quote scope is unspecified. The search was partial, so this is not proof that no other award options exist.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A26@2027-01-09/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United lead — January 9\",\"v\":\"This is a partial award lead, not a complete itinerary: the result lists SFO–BKK in economy for 55,000 United miles, 9 seats, and USD 16.20 in award taxes. The fee quote’s scope is unknown, so it cannot be treated as a per-traveler or all-in amount. The schedule is date-only; routing and leg-by-leg cabins are not supplied. Confirm the itinerary, current seats, and terms with United before relying on it.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A2@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"United lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"A second partial United economy lead lists 60,500 United miles, 9 seats, and USD 28.20 in award taxes for January 1. Compared with the January 9 United lead shown above, this one lists more miles and higher fees, but it is a different date and neither result supplies a schedule or routing. Fee scope is unknown, and the listed cabin does not establish every leg’s cabin.\"},{\"k\":\"l\",\"r\":\"A3@2027-01-01/SFO>BKK/E\",\"n\":\"Alaska lead — January 1\",\"v\":\"This partial economy lead lists 42,500 Alaska miles, 8 seats, and USD 50.90 in award taxes for January 1. It uses Alaska miles, not United miles, so the lower number of miles is not a like-for-like value comparison. Its fee scope is unknown; schedule, routing, and leg-by-leg cabins are not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-01T22:55-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — January 1\",\"v\":\"The shown cash itinerary is on Cathay Pacific from SFO via HKG to BKK, with one stop. It departs January 1 at 10:55 p.m. San Francisco time and arrives January 4 at 10:35 a.m. Bangkok time; elapsed time is 44 hours 40 minutes. The listed fare is USD 640.00, but its quote scope is unknown, so it is not established as a per-traveler or all-in total. The source reports an itinerary for 1 traveler.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Before booking, verify current availability and prices with the relevant airline: the search results may not be real-time, and some search coverage was partial. The award leads’ reported seat counts do not confirm current bookability.\"}]}"
